{"song": "Avercage_-_Embers", "config": "chunk30", "model": "models/asr", "seconds": 242.5569375, "maxNewTokens": 368, "elapsed": 410.79353404045105, "exit": 0, "chunks": [{"index": 3, "offset": 94.77, "length": 34.26, "raw": "\"Just feel the bottom, so you burn and die. Hey, hey, what you want? Live for love, live on the edge. Nothing in doubt, no blame, no name. It's only love, only love. One day it all will come.\""}, {"index": 1, "offset": 31.28, "length": 33.91, "raw": "\"The chaos undoes, continues on its path to end. We all know when you're leading it to the end. Never whispered, never be open. We all know when the moment's right, we ignite.\""}, {"index": 5, "offset": 156.39, "length": 32.81, "raw": "\"And I still promise.\""}, {"index": 0, "offset": 0.0, "length": 31.28, "raw": "\"Embers. Artist: Avercage.\""}, {"index": 2, "offset": 65.19, "length": 29.58, "raw": "\"Shine with the embers of one day. One day. One day. One day. Not forever, not forever. Don't close your eyes. Not forever, not forever.\""}, {"index": 7, "offset": 214.44, "length": 28.12, "raw": "\"Never, never, once in the end, the flame was rendered, but living embers will burn.\""}, {"index": 4, "offset": 129.03, "length": 27.36, "raw": "\"Forever, gone forever. Don't close your eyes. Gone forever, gone forever.\""}, {"index": 6, "offset": 189.2, "length": 25.23, "raw": "\"One day, oh, oh, forever, oh, forever, don't close your eyes, oh, forever, oh, forever, let's move our bodies.\""}], "result": {"language": "English", "text": "Embers. Artist: Avercage.The chaos undoes, continues on its path to end. We all know when you're leading it to the end. Never whispered, never be open. We all know when the moment's right, we ignite.Shine with the embers of one day. One day. One day. One day. Not forever, not forever. Don't close your eyes. Not forever, not forever.Just feel the bottom, so you burn and die. Hey, hey, what you want? Live for love, live on the edge. Nothing in doubt, no blame, no name. It's only love, only love. One day it all will come.Forever, gone forever. Don't close your eyes. Gone forever, gone forever.And I still promise.One day, oh, oh, forever, oh, forever, don't close your eyes, oh, forever, oh, forever, let's move our bodies.Never, never, once in the end, the flame was rendered, but living embers will burn.", "timestamps": {"items": [{"end_time": 0.0, "start_time": 0.0, "text": "Embers"}, {"end_time": 0.0, "start_time": 0.0, "text": "Artist"}, {"end_time": 0.0, "start_time": 0.0, "text": "Avercage"}, {"end_time": 32.076, "start_time": 31.276, "text": "The"}, {"end_time": 33.996, "start_time": 32.076, "text": "chaos"}, {"end_time": 34.476, "start_time": 34.476, "text": "undoes"}, {"end_time": 34.956, "start_time": 34.476, "text": "continues"}, {"end_time": 38.556, "start_time": 36.876, "text": "on"}, {"end_time": 40.076, "start_time": 40.076, "text": "its"}, {"end_time": 40.076, "start_time": 40.076, "text": "path"}, {"end_time": 40.236, "start_time": 40.076, "text": "to"}, {"end_time": 40.556, "start_time": 40.236, "text": "end"}, {"end_time": 41.276, "start_time": 40.556, "text": "We"}, {"end_time": 42.316, "start_time": 41.276, "text": "all"}, {"end_time": 42.636, "start_time": 42.396, "text": "know"}, {"end_time": 42.636, "start_time": 42.636, "text": "when"}, {"end_time": 43.116, "start_time": 42.956, "text": "you're"}, {"end_time": 44.156, "start_time": 43.116, "text": "leading"}, {"end_time": 44.236, "start_time": 44.156, "text": "it"}, {"end_time": 44.236, "start_time": 44.236, "text": "to"}, {"end_time": 47.036, "start_time": 44.236, "text": "the"}, {"end_time": 47.036, "start_time": 47.036, "text": "end"}, {"end_time": 47.116, "start_time": 47.116, "text": "Never"}, {"end_time": 49.196, "start_time": 47.116, "text": "whispered"}, {"end_time": 49.676, "start_time": 49.196, "text": "never"}, {"end_time": 49.676, "start_time": 49.676, "text": "be"}, {"end_time": 54.796, "start_time": 49.676, "text": "open"}, {"end_time": 55.916